senses
  entry
    definition "conforming with or constituting a norm or standard or level or type or social norm; not abnormal"
    examples ("serve wine at normal room temperature" "normal diplomatic relations" "normal working hours" "normal word order" "normal curiosity" "the normal course of events")
    id oewn-01598231-a
    partOfSpeech a
  entry
    definition "in accordance with scientific laws"
    id oewn-01604027-a
    partOfSpeech a
  entry
    definition "being approximately average or within certain limits in e.g. intelligence and development"
    examples ("a perfectly normal child" "of normal intelligence" "the most normal person I've ever met")
    id oewn-01602901-a
    partOfSpeech a
  entry
    definition "something regarded as a normative example"
    examples ("the convention of not naming the main character" "violence is the rule not the exception" "his formula for impressing visitors")
    id oewn-05675457-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (convention pattern rule formula)
  entry
    definition "forming a right angle"
    id oewn-01724784-s
    partOfSpeech s
